                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A 6DOF shooter where you're purging your body of viruses and other tiny nasties.  The gameplay itself is alright, though it's rather weird that the mouse only moves the aiming cursor on screen, not the camera. That's a separate button to change to camera mode where you can only move the camera, making it cumbersome or just risky to use in combat. Music is decent too.\n\nThis game stutters like crazy. Literally every few seconds. Most targets are big and don't require precise aiming, but it is still incredibly annoying and unacceptable at this frequency. 3 of the Achievements also don't work. What would've been an alright thumbs up is turned into a thumbs down thanks to these.",
